<MakerLayout title="About PARADOX Makers" description="About PARADOX Makers, a free browser-first generator studio."><main class="maker-main"><article class="maker-why"><div class="maker-label">ABOUT</div><h1>Useful first.<br/>Fancy later.</h1><p>PARADOX Makers is a collection of tiny browser tools that turn a simple input into something useful: a bingo card, a word search, a team list, a bracket, a raffle sheet, a seating chart or a certificate.</p><h2>Why generators?</h2><p>People often know exactly what they need but do not want to learn a software package to make it. A focused generator can remove that friction in seconds.</p><h2>Why no account?</h2><p>The core product is designed around fast, local generation. There is no reason to make someone register just to create a worksheet or randomize a group.</p><h2>How the site is funded</h2><p>The basic generators are free. PARADOX Makers uses legitimate advertising to support the public site rather than putting routine creation behind a subscription.</p></article></main></MakerLayout>
